{
  "provider": "bytedance-openspeech-doubao-asr",
  "flash_url": "https://openspeech.bytedance.com/api/v3/auc/bigmodel/recognize/flash",
  "resource_id": "volc.bigasr.auc_turbo",
  "app_id": "${ENV:DOUBAO_APP_ID}",
  "access_token": "${ENV:DOUBAO_ACCESS_TOKEN}",
  "request_defaults": {
    "model_name": "bigmodel",
    "enable_itn": true,
    "show_utterances": true
  },
  "_setup": [
    "首次使用：在系统环境变量里设置 DOUBAO_APP_ID 和 DOUBAO_ACCESS_TOKEN。",
    "凭据来自火山引擎控制台 → 语音技术 → 语音识别（流式极速版 auc_turbo）。",
    "也可把上面的 ${ENV:...} 直接替换成你自己的明文凭据（仅限本机、勿提交或分享）。"
  ]
}
